#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Limited compatibility support for the SysV client interface, as implemented "
"by the systemd-initctl\\&.service unit\\&. This is a named pipe in the file "
"system\\&. This interface is obsolete and should not be used in new "
"applications\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid "/usr/lib/clock-epoch"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"The modification time (\"mtime\") of this file is used for the time epoch, "
"see previous section\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid "/var/lib/systemd/timesync/clock"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"The modification time (\"mtime\") of this file is updated by B<systemd-"
"timesyncd.service>(8)\\&. If present, the modification time of file is used "
"for the epoch, see previous section\\&."
msgstr ""

